      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Qus 2-> Why dont we push node_modules to git? if we are not pushing then how other developer\n    will get that?",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Qus 2-> Why dont we push node_modules to git? if we are not pushing then how other developer\n    will get that?",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "JPEAycsliP7PsqyGd5pGb",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1394.7026032911454,
      "y": 84097.06435344061,
      "width": 1023,
      "height": 75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "#a5d8ff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bqt",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1322517418,
      "version": 313,
      "versionNonce": 1892299635,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1781083423556,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Because node_modules is very large in size, so we dont push, other developers can just run\nnpm install, then they will get node_modules folder.\nand this will install all node module using dependencies and devdependies inside package.json",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Because node_modules is very large in size, so we dont push, other developers can just run\nnpm install, then they will get node_modules folder.\nand this will install all node module using dependencies and devdependies inside package.json",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "j3atgVbbf76ySHY1UqMYj",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1345.1947907911454,
      "y": 84280.10732219061,
      "width": 627,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
