      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1781083423556,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "we dont use Higher Order Component\n\nwhen we were creating classbased component there we need Higher Order Componets. with functions\nwe can create these but there is no need.\n\nthese are the component, who take component as parameter and return a new component.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "we dont use Higher Order Component\n\nwhen we were creating classbased component there we need Higher Order Componets. with functions\nwe can create these but there is no need.\n\nthese are the component, who take component as parameter and return a new component.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
