      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1781085494104,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "we will say give me the jd I need to hire 3-4 year experience backend engineer\nWhere I can put this GD -> Naukri\nI have 8 applications please help me who is capable enough according to JD\nokay 2 are there, Can you help me for drafting email for this\ntell me interview questions that I need to ask\n\nI finalise 1 candidate, draft me one offer letter for him\n\nbefore that we need to do everything manually but now GenAI is helping.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "we will say give me the jd I need to hire 3-4 year experience backend engineer\nWhere I can put this GD -> Naukri\nI have 8 applications please help me who is capable enough according to JD\nokay 2 are there, Can you help me for drafting email for this\ntell me interview questions that I need to ask\n\nI finalise 1 candidate, draft me one offer letter for him\n\nbefore that we need to do everything manually but now GenAI is helping.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
